# Response headers for static hosting (Cloudflare Pages reads this file from
# the build output; other hosts need the same headers configured). Verified
# against the release build in Chrome with the policy enforced: see
# docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
#
# CSP notes: 'wasm-unsafe-eval' lets the page compile WebAssembly (CanvasKit,
# librakia, SQLite) without allowing eval(); the build uses --csp and
# --no-web-resources-cdn, so every script, font and module comes from this
# origin and no inline script is allowed. style-src keeps 'unsafe-inline'
# because Flutter's web engine sets inline styles on its own elements (the
# check fails without it). connect-src allows the RAKIA API on Render
# (staging and production), the only other origin the app calls; a build
# names which one with --dart-define=RAKIA_API_URL. The API answers with
# CORS headers, which cross-origin isolation requires. Sign-in calls
# Firebase Authentication's REST API (identitytoolkit, securetoken), and
# account creation loads Cloudflare Turnstile's script and frame from
# challenges.cloudflare.com, the only third-party script; Turnstile works
# under COEP require-corp (verified in Chrome). COOP and COEP make the page cross-origin isolated,
# which lets the local database use the Origin Private File System.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://rakia-api-staging.onrender.com https://rakia-api.onrender.com https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
